    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CardShop Simulator Multiplayer is a trading card shop simulation where you sell card  packs to earn money and build your card shop business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569500/extras/2dc6b1f88af963a2046be888c6e4f04a.avif?t=1754022681\" width=610 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your own Puk\u00e9moe card shop. Organize shelves and card packs to make customer shopping experience smooth and easy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569500/extras/f2dc85f5979b16a74c85846d688ea826.poster.avif?t=1754022681\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569500/extras/f2dc85f5979b16a74c85846d688ea826.webm?t=1754022681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569500/extras/f2dc85f5979b16a74c85846d688ea826.mp4?t=1754022681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569500/extras/f15da872793f79eb36fc22438c0829aa.avif?t=1754022681\" width=610 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy opening cards packs as much as you want to. Test your luck and find super rare cards to complete your Puk\u00e9moe card collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569500/extras/8625aae4170d284307dd60de27d8244f.poster.avif?t=1754022681\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569500/extras/8625aae4170d284307dd60de27d8244f.webm?t=1754022681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569500/extras/8625aae4170d284307dd60de27d8244f.mp4?t=1754022681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569500/extras/4f7a965fb85aaa7656bdcdf475f81e2a.poster.avif?t=1754022681\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569500/extras/4f7a965fb85aaa7656bdcdf475f81e2a.webm?t=1754022681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569500/extras/4f7a965fb85aaa7656bdcdf475f81e2a.mp4?t=1754022681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569500/extras/8a7fb68021e8c2b91318807345d886ea.avif?t=1754022681\" width=610 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569500/extras/a1bd6ac489ecb53c10999c7574661e4f.poster.avif?t=1754022681\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569500/extras/a1bd6ac489ecb53c10999c7574661e4f.webm?t=1754022681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569500/extras/a1bd6ac489ecb53c10999c7574661e4f.mp4?t=1754022681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569500/extras/b286d2b6bd3e21a7cc7934ee9b295688.poster.avif?t=1754022681\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569500/extras/b286d2b6bd3e21a7cc7934ee9b295688.webm?t=1754022681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569500/extras/b286d2b6bd3e21a7cc7934ee9b295688.mp4?t=1754022681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the cards as the bet, play card battles with NPC and your friends. If you win, you can take their cards into your collection!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569500/extras/626d53facf31ab7ed9cd8119dc068c97.avif?t=1754022681\" width=610 height=86 /></span>'</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569500/extras/7043e8e40b90f723f172a339ab07ee9c.poster.avif?t=1754022681\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569500/extras/7043e8e40b90f723f172a339ab07ee9c.webm?t=1754022681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569500/extras/7043e8e40b90f723f172a339ab07ee9c.mp4?t=1754022681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569500/extras/7be9b9f23fb198fab4246f42c8227cb2.poster.avif?t=1754022681\" width=600 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569500/extras/7be9b9f23fb198fab4246f42c8227cb2.webm?t=1754022681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569500/extras/7be9b9f23fb198fab4246f42c8227cb2.mp4?t=1754022681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the street to find treasures, interesting random activities awaiting, more hiding secrets. Remember that 'LUCK determines a lot'!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CardShop Simulator Multiplayer is a trading card shop simulation where you sell card  packs to earn money and build your card shop business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569500/extras/2dc6b1f88af963a2046be888c6e4f04a.avif?t=1754022681\" width=610 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your own Puk\u00e9moe card shop. Organize shelves and card packs to make customer shopping experience smooth and easy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569500/extras/f2dc85f5979b16a74c85846d688ea826.poster.avif?t=1754022681\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569500/extras/f2dc85f5979b16a74c85846d688ea826.webm?t=1754022681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569500/extras/f2dc85f5979b16a74c85846d688ea826.mp4?t=1754022681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569500/extras/f15da872793f79eb36fc22438c0829aa.avif?t=1754022681\" width=610 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy opening cards packs as much as you want to. Test your luck and find super rare cards to complete your Puk\u00e9moe card collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569500/extras/8625aae4170d284307dd60de27d8244f.poster.avif?t=1754022681\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.c