d.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569500/extras/b286d2b6bd3e21a7cc7934ee9b295688.poster.avif?t=1754022681\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569500/extras/b286d2b6bd3e21a7cc7934ee9b295688.webm?t=1754022681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569500/extras/b286d2b6bd3e21a7cc7934ee9b295688.mp4?t=1754022681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the cards as the bet, play card battles with NPC and your friends. If you win, you can take their cards into your collection!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569500/extras/626d53facf31ab7ed9cd8119dc068c97.avif?t=1754022681\" width=610 height=86 /></span>'</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569500/extras/7043e8e40b90f723f172a339ab07ee9c.poster.avif?t=1754022681\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569500/extras/7043e8e40b90f723f172a339ab07ee9c.webm?t=1754022681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569500/extras/7043e8e40b90f723f172a339ab07ee9c.mp4?t=1754022681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569500/extras/7be9b9f23fb198fab4246f42c8227cb2.poster.avif?t=1754022681\" width=600 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569500/extras/7be9b9f23fb198fab4246f42c8227cb2.webm?t=1